# Example VPN chain profile — copy to profiles/<name>.profile
# One layer per line: a NetworkManager connection name, or a WireGuard /
# wg-quick interface name. Order = chain order (first line = base tunnel,
# each following line tunnels over the previous one).
#
# Single VPN:
#   nova-master
#
# Chain (inner routed over outer):
#   nova-master      # layer 1: reaches the internet
#   nova-inner       # layer 2: runs inside layer 1
